content.text:
Confirmed: the repo requires DUC 2001/2002/2004 datasets (NIST-licensed, requires signed agreement) and the ROUGE-1.5.5 package (requires a separate registered license from isi.edu). Neither can be legally/publicly auto-downloaded. This is the primary, genuine blocker independent of environment issues.

```json
{
  "paper_url": "https://aclanthology.org/D18-1445/",
  "paper_accessible": true,
  "paper_metrics_claimed": [
    {"metric": "ROUGE-1/2 (near-optimal summary quality vs. oracle/heuristic baselines)", "value": "reported as learning curves / bar charts, e.g. APRIL reaches ~oracle-level ROUGE within ~40-60 interaction rounds on DUC01/02/04", "dataset": "DUC2001/DUC2002/DUC2004", "setting": "active preference learning + RL (uncertainty sampling querier + TD reward)"}
  ],
  "env_setup": {
    "python_version_required": "3.6 (README: 'tested with Python 3.6 on Ubuntu 16.04')",
    "evidence": "README.md Prerequisites section explicitly states Python3.6; requirement.txt pins numpy==1.15.0/scipy==1.1.0/scikit-learn==0.19.2 (2018-era versions with no modern wheels)",
    "venv_created": true,
    "venv_path": "/tmp/venv_april",
    "actual_python": "3.8.20 (closest uv-installable version; uv does not support 3.6/3.7)",
    "note": "Even with 3.8, pinned numpy==1.15.0 failed to build from source (no prebuilt wheel for this interpreter/OS combo, legacy build system) -> pip install of requirement.txt failed"
  },
  "data": {
    "datasets_needed": ["DUC2001", "DUC2002", "DUC2004", "ROUGE-1.5.5 (scoring toolkit, licensed)", "Stanford Parser models (separate license)"],
    "available_in_repo": false,
    "downloaded": [],
    "license_blocked": ["DUC2001", "DUC2002", "DUC2004", "ROUGE-1.5.5", "Stanford Parser (englishPCFG.ser.gz etc.)"]
  },
  "install": {
    "status": "failed",
    "log_tail": "ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'numpy' after `pip install numpy==1.15.0 scipy==1.1.0` exited code 1 on Python 3.8 venv; scikit-learn==0.19.2 build also fails without numpy present at build time (legacy-install-failure)"
  },
  "run": {
    "command": "not attempted (no data, no ROUGE toolkit, deps not installable)",
    "status": "not_run",
    "output_tail": ""
  },
  "actual_results": null,
  "repro_verdict": "blocked_data_licensed",
  "blocker_attribution": "genuine",
  "verdict_reason": "核心数据集DUC2001/2002/2004需要向NIST签署使用协议获取,评测所需ROUGE-1.5.5工具包也需单独注册下载许可,均无法公开自动获取,属于仓库本身的真实限制(而非环境搭建问题);次要地,requirement.txt锁定的2018年老版本numpy/scipy/scikit-learn在任何可用的Python(3.8+)上也无法直接安装,进一步印证该仓库已过时、难以在不修改代码的前提下复现。"
}
```

